1 NAME Violet Virginia /Egly/
2 GIVN Violet Virginia
2 SURN Egly
2 _MARNM Ringenberg
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Highland Park Cemetery, Fort Wayne, Allen County, Indiana, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 21 JUL 1923
2 PLAC Adams County, Indiana, USA
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 4 FEB 2013
2 PLAC Woodburn, Allen County, Indiana, USA
2 ADDR
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Violet V. Ringenberg, 89, of Woodburn died Monday, February 4, 2013, at her home where she was lovingly cared for by her family, and the wonderful staff of Heartland Hospice.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Adams County, she was the daughter of the late Valentine and Ida Egly.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a member of Woodburn Missionary Church, Taylor University Fort Wayne Alumni Council, and the Woodburn Home Economics Club.
2 CONT
2 CONT Violet was a loving and dedicated pastor's wife, who was always by her husband's side.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by her husband of 67 years, Gerald Ringenberg; her children, Roger (Carol) Ringenberg and Gary Ringenberg, both of Fort Wayne, and Dorcas (Dave) McDeavitt of Woodburn; her foster daughter, Yvonne (Randy) Nigh of Ru
2 CONC shville; her siblings, Glenna (Milt) Wong of Fort Wayne, and Lester (Carole) Egly of Travelers Rest, S.C.; 13 grandchildren; and 13 great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her siblings, Albert Egly, Chloetta Erdel and Carolyn Nussbaum.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral service is at 10:30 a.m. Saturday, February 9, 2013, at Woodburn Missionary Church, 5108 Bull Rapids Road, Woodburn, with calling one hour prior.  Pastor Joel DeSelm will officiate.
2 CONT
2 CONT Calling is also 2 to 8 p.m. Friday, February 8, 2013, at the church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Entombment is in Highland Park Cemetery, Fort Wayne.
2 CONT
2 CONT Preferred memorials are to Woodburn Missionary Church or Fort Wayne Alumni Resource Center/Taylor University.  E. Harper & Son Funeral Home, New Haven, is in charge of arrangements.
2 CONT
2 CONT To share online condolences or read the full obituary, please visit www.harperfuneralhome.com
2 CONT
2 CONT kpcnews.com
2 CONT Wednesday, February 6, 2013* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/104741490/violet-v-ringenberg Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 16 2023, 6:32:23 UTC''
