2 CONT Hannah Overholt Grabill Schlabach, daughter of John Overholt  (1820-1890, Allen Co,IN) & his wife Anna  Drissel Overholt (1827-1871).
2 CONT John 2nd married Veronica Stuckey Overholt
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah 1st married 1874 Jacob Grabill
2 CONT
2 CONT 2nd married 6 April 1922 (& died 34 days later) to Shem Schlabach
2 CONT
