2 CONC Magdalena 5/12 IN (parents b France,PA)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1900 VanBuren Twp, Daviess Co,IN - Grabill, head Jacob 45 OH (both parents b France & married 26 yrs), wife Hanah 45 PA (both parents b PA & married 26 yrs & 7 children, 5 living), son John H 18 IN (parents b OH,PA), son Abraham 1
2 CONC 2 IN (parents b OH,PA) & daughter  Anna B 7 IN (parents b OH,PA)
2 CONT
2 CONT 1910 Columbia Twp, Gibson Co,IN - Grabill, head Jacob 63 OH (both parents b France & married 26 yrs), wife Hanah 55 PA (both parents b PA & married 26 yrs & 7 children, 5 living), son Henry 27 IN (parents b OH,PA) & daughter  Anna
2 CONC  B 16 TN (parents b OH,PA)
2 CONT
