1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth 	17 Jan 1960 Fort Wayne, Allen County, Indiana, USA Death 	4 May 2020 (aged 60) Camden, Hillsdale County, Michigan, USA Burial 	 Amish Cemeery Camden, Hillsdale County, Michigan, USA Memorial ID 	209797117 · 
2 CONC View Source Naomi B. Eicher January 17, 1960 - May 4, 2020
2 CONT
2 CONT Naomi B. Eicher, 60, of Camden, passed away Monday, May 4, 2020 at her home. She was born January 17, 1960 in Ft. Wayne, IN to Martin and Effie Mae (Brandenger) Steury. Naomi married Silas Eicher and he survives.
2 CONT
2 CONT Besides her husband, Silas, Naomi is survived by five daughters, Salome (Alvin) Graber, Effie Mae (John) Wagler, Priscilla (Rubin) Graber Jr., Naomi (Andy) Graber and Eunice (Jonas) Steury; six sons, Samuel (RoseAnn) Eicher, Silas
2 CONC  Eicher, Simon (Suzanne) Eicher, Mathew Eicher, Victor Eicher and Martin Eicher; seven sisters; seven brothers; and 25 grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Naomi was preceded in death by her parents.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services for Naomi Eicher have been set for Thursday, May 7, 2020 at 10:00 AM at her residence in Camden, Michigan. Burial will follow at Camden Amish Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrangements are entrusted to the Eagle Funeral Home-George White Chapel in Reading.
