2 CONT OBIT:  Abbie H. Yoder 96 Salisbury RD 1 died at her home in Elk Lick Township on April 12 1983. She was born March 19 1867 in Arthur Illinois the daughter of Jacob and Lydia (Otto) Helmuth. She was preceded in death by her parents
2 CONC  and husband Samuel U. Yoder also a son Joseph and one grandson. She is survived by a son Elmer S. Yoder Grantsville Maryland and daughters Maryann Yoder Salisbury and Mrs. Lena Schrock Oakland Maryland. Also 17 grandchildren and 
2 CONC 19 great-grandchildren. She was a member of the Old Order Amish Niverton. Services were held Friday April 15 at 9:30 a.m. at the Niverton Amish Church with Rev. Bennie A. Yoder officiating. Interment Niverton Amish Cemetery. The R
2 CONC epublic April 21 1983* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/125705272/abigail_h_yoder Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 26 2024, 3:58:05 UTC''
