1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Husband: 
2 CONT Raymond R Dunlap
2 CONT b. 08 Jun 1911
2 CONT d. 04 Dec 1973
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The Commercial Review 
2 CONT Portland, Indiana 
2 CONT (Jay County) 
2 CONT Tuesday, September 25, 2007 
2 CONT
2 CONT Eva M. Dunlap, 92, Lafayette, a Geneva native, died Sunday at Rosewalk Village 
2 CONT in Lafayette. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born on Oct. 19, 1914, in Geneva, to Simon and Sarah (Yoder) Egly, she graduated 
2 CONT from Leo High School and attended Lutheran Hospital School of Nursing in Fort 
2 CONT Wayne. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married in 1935 to Raymond E. Dunlap, who preceded her in death. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include a daughter, Ann L. Skadberg,, Lafayette; four grandchildren 
2 CONT and nine great-grandchildren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Private family services will be held in Berne at a later date. The family 
2 CONT requests no flowers. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Soller-Baker of Lafayette is in charge of the arrangements.
