2 CONT
2 CONT The Egly family are active members of the Community Church of God, formerly the First Church of God in Danville with Lois' sister, Marian's grandson, serving as the current pastor. For about 30 years, Lois and family worshipped at
2 CONC  the Stringtown Church of God where she taught Sunday school and was the Worship pianist. 
2 CONT
2 CONT As young ladies Lois, Dorothy, Clara and Marian sang in a quartet with Alice on the piano at several functions in Lincoln Park. Lois worked in bookkeeping for several businesses around Danville, Ill., two of which were Sears Roebu
2 CONC ck and then retiring from Lakeview Medical Center. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also surviving are her children, Mary Anne Cecil, Edward Lee (Julie) York, Martha Jane (Richard) Garza and Jonathan Paul (Roberta) York; siblings, Dorothy (Harold) Garner, Glenn Egly and Alan (Pat) Egly; grandchildren, Jesse (Mich
