1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Blufton News-Banner - (May/14/2010)
2 CONT
2 CONT Max E. Egly, 83
2 CONT Wells County native Max E. Egly, 83, of Salt Lake City, Utah, died May 12, 2010.
2 CONT Mr. Egly was born Jan. 28, 1927, in Petroleum, to Christian Egly and Helen French Egly.
2 CONT Survivors include his wife of 53 years, Joan; two sons, Michael Egly and Jeffery Egly; and a sister, Christine Melick of Bluffton.
2 CONT He was preceded in death by two brothers, Robert Egly and Donald Egly.
2 CONT Services will be held at 11 a.m. (MDT) Saturday, May 15, at St. Marks Cathedral in Salt Lake City.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/70526618/max-eugene-egly Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/S
2 CONC martCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 17 2023, 7:11:05 UTC''
