1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Martha J. (Shetler) Hilty, 91, of Berne, IN, passed away at 5:20 AM on Monday, October 07, 2013 at her home in Berne, IN. She was born to Jacob and Amanda Hershberger Shetler on Friday, March 17, 1922, in Holmes Co
2 CONC unty, OH. She married Joseph A. Hilty on Thursday, January 16, 1947 in Monroe, IN, he passed away on August 24, 2000. Mrs. Hilty was a member of the Old Order Amish.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors Include: Daughter - Amanda (Atlee) Hershberger, Wooster, OH., Daughter - Annie (Johnny) Wickey, Berne, IN., Daughter - Martha (Emanuel) Schwartz, Berne, IN., Daughter - Barbara (John) Graber, Geneva, IN., Daughter - Elma
2 CONC  (Elmer A.) Schwartz, Monroe, IN., Son - Henry A.M. (Verena) Hilty, Monroe, IN., Son - Elmer M. (Esther) Hilty, Monroe, IN., Son - Daniel M. Hilty, Denver, CO., 72 Grandchildren, many living Great Grandchildren, Brother - Valentin
2 CONC e J. Shetler., Berne, IN, Brother - Andrew J. Shetler, Monroe, IN., Brother - Mose J. Shetler, LaGrange, IN and Sister - Frannie J. (Shetler) Hilty, Berne, IN.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her: Father - Jacob Shetler, Mother - Amanda (Hershberger) Shetler, Husband - Joseph A. Hilty, Brothers - Daniel Shetler, Samuel Shetler, Eli Shetler, Levi Shetler, Jacob Shetler, Henry Shetler and Sis
2 CONC ter - Annie J. (Shetler) Coblentz.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Viewing Hours will be held at Emanuel H. Schwartz Residence 2625 S. US 27 Berne on Tuesday, October 08, 2013 from 2:00 PM to 8:00 PM and from 9:00 AM to 8:00 PM on Wednesday, October 09, 2013.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Funeral Service will be held at Emanuel H. Schwartz Residence 2625 S. US 27 Berne at 9:00 AM on Thursday, October 10, 2013 with Bishop Marvin L. Hilty officiating. Interment will follow in the Schwartz Cemetery in Monroe
