2 CONC ves.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a homemaker and a member of the Old Order Amish Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include sons; John H. Wickey of Berne, Joe H. Wickey of Berne, Chris H. Hilty of Berne, Marvin H.Wickey of Monroe, Merlin H. Wickey of Berne, Stephen H. Wickey of Berne, Matthew H. Wickey of Berne, daughters; Elma H Shet
2 CONC ler of Berne, Laura H. Eicher of Berne brothers; Elmer M Hilty of Monroe, Henry M. Hilty of Monroe, Daniel M. Hilty of Denver, Color., sisters, Amanda Hershberger of Apple Creek, OH., Barbara Graber of Geneva, Martha Schwartz of B
2 CONC erne, Elma Schwartz of Berne, 62 grandchidren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Preceding in death are her parents and 4 grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services are Friday, August 29, 2014 at 9 AM at the residence(2383 W., State Road 218) Berne. Visitation also Wednesday from 1 to 8 PM and Thursday from 9AM to 8PM at the home. Officiating is Marvin L. Hilty. Burial is in 
2 CONC the Oak Ridge Cemetery, rural Berne.
