1 NOTE {geni:about_me} VICTOR MILLER, 80 OF SPENCERVILLE, INDIANA DIED WEDNESDAY AT PARKVIEW HOSPITAL. 
2 CONT THE ALLEN COUNTY NATIVE WAS RETIRED FROM GRABERHOMES AS A CARPENTER AFTER 33 YEARS OF SERVICE.
2 CONT SURVIVING ARE HIS WIFE: ROSA ANN (DELAGRANGE) MILLER, SONS ELMER OF NEW HAVEN, IN, MERVIN OF HAMILTON, INDIANA, MARVIN OF ANTWERP, OHIO, & REUBEN OF HUNTERTOWN, INDIANA, AND DAUGHTERS, LAVEDA (RUSSELL) LILLY OF HICKSVILLE, OHIO,
2 CONT KATHERINE IRENE (TERRY) HART, OF HICKSVILLE, OHIO, ROSE (RANDY) DAVIS OF DECATUR, INDIANA, VERNA (DOUGLAS) PHILLIPS OF CEDARVILLE, INDIANA. 
2 CONT BROTHERS: DAVID MILLER JR, OF GRABILL, WILLIAM (AMANDA) MILLER OF NEW HAVEN, INDIANA, JOSEPH (MARGARET) MILLER OF NEW HAVEN, INDIANA, A SISTER, LUCY (EMANUEL) GRABER OF NEW HAVEN, INDIANA. 
2 CONT 35 GRANDCHILDREN, AND 28 GREAT-GRAND-CHILDREN
2 CONT SERVICES ARE AT 10 AM SUNDAY AT RIDGEVIEW MENNONITE CHURCH, ROBERTS RD, HARLAN, INDIANA, WITH CALLING ONE HOUR BEFORE SERVICES. CALLING IS ALSO NOON TO 9 PM FRIDAY & SATURDAY AT THE CHURCH. 
2 CONT ARRANGEMENTS ARE BY HOCKEMEYER FUNERAL HOME, HARLAN, INDIANA. BURIAL WILL BE IN SCHLATTER CEMETERY, LEO, INDIANA* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/73950265/victor_miller Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.co
