2 CONT JOSEPH MILLER (SEPTEMBER 9,2003)
2 CONT   CRASH CLAIMS LIFE OF NEW HAVEN,INDIANA MAN, 84.
2 CONT A NEW HAVEN MAN DIED IN A CAR CRASH AT INDIANA 37 AND CUBA ROAD ON TUESDAY, INDIANA STATE POLICE SAID.
2 CONT A CAR DRIVEN BY WILLIAM H LENGERICH, 75, OF DECATUR, WAS STRUCK BY A TRUCK DRIVEN BY CONRAD A ALEXANDER, 51 OF EDON,OHIO, ABOUT 3:20 PM., A REPORT SAID.
2 CONT LENGERICH'S CAR WAS NIT ON PASSENGER SIDE, AND PASSENGER JOSEPH MILLER,84 OF NEW HAVEN, WAS KILLED IN THE CRASH.
2 CONT LENGERICH HAD MINOR INJURIES AND WAS TAKEN TO AN AREA HOSPITAL, A REPORT SAID. 
2 CONT MILLER WAS WEARING A SEAT BELT, A REPORT SAID.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/76306024/joseph_miller Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 2 2024, 23:17:16 UTC'
