1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fort Wayne IN News-Sentinel
2 CONT February 18, 1993 
2 CONT Page: 10A
2 CONT
2 CONT MERVIN LENGACHER, 68, of rural Fort Wayne died Tuesday at home.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Allen County native was a homebuilder for 20 years and founder of A- AAA Locksmith Co.
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving are his wife, Verna; daughters, Janet Smith and Leila Lengacher, both of Fort Wayne, Bethene Guarnieri of Webster MA, and Nyla Lengacher of New Orleans; sons, Milton, Darcy and Lydell, all of Fort Wayne; a brother, Louis
2 CONC  L. of Grabill; and three grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorial services are 4 pm Saturday in Central Mennonite Church. There is no calling in Hockemeyer Funeral Home Harlan.
2 CONT
