2 CONT The existence of this burial is based on its inclusion in genealogist Barbara Ford's 1995 book titled "The Oberholtzer Book". The photo provided by a find a grave volunteer shows the missing stone at the burial location (an incred
2 CONC ible extra effort by the volunteer).
2 CONT
2 CONT This family of Overholt/Oberholtzers appears to be directly related to the others buried in Bucks Co, PA. (including of course, William's father).
2 CONT
2 CONT William Overholt was a Reverend in the Mennonite Church. He and his wife Gertrude were the parents of eleven children, of which at least eight grew to adulthood.
