2 CONT HISTAND - Florence L., daughter of Bro. Samuel and Sister Susie Histand of near Doylestown, Pa., died Jan. 27, 1918; aged 11m. 18d. Death was caused by meningitis. Besides her parents she leaves 7 sisters and 7 brothers. Funeral F
2 CONC eb. 1, at Doylestown Mennonite Church conducted by Bros. David L. Gehman, Jacob C. Clemmens, and Jacob Rush. Text, Luke 8:52. Interment in adjoining cemetery. "Sleep on in thy beauty, Thou sweet angel child. By sorrow unblighted, 
2 CONC By sin undefiled."
2 CONT
2 CONT Gospel Herald, February 14, 1918
