2 CONT
2 CONT Baptist; dairy, Denbigh VA; poultry farm, Lumberville 1944-46; dairy, Denbigh VA 1947-48; self-photographer 1949-50; Culligan, Hatboro PA, lived in Lambertville NJ 1951-53; poultry, Denbigh VA to 1956; manager, boys' dept., Sears 
2 CONC 1956-68; photographer; owners-operators, Wood Box Gift Shop, Newport News VA James was an aerial photographer, an avid reader and was former proprietor of The Wood Box retail gift shop in the Sherwood Shopping Center. He was a mem
2 CONC ber of Denbigh Baptist Church and had attended Hilton Baptist Church. James was very generous, thoughtful, kind and loved to socialize. (obituary, Daily Press, Newport News, VA)
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: James worked as an aerial photographer and I got the pleasure of viewing some of his many pictures he had taken over his career. He was a very sweet and talented man. 
