2 CONT HENRY L. BOWER, 92, OF FREDERICK LIVING Henry L. Bower, 92, of Frederick Living, formerly of Boyertown, husband of the late Evelyn J. (Steltz) Bower, passed away on Saturday. Born in Souderton, he was the son of the late Dr. Abram
2 CONC  L. and Hannah Bower. Henry was a member of Souderton Mennonite Church, Boyertown Mennonite Church and Hereford Mennonite Church, where he served as Deacon, Sunday School Superintendent and adult teacher, was a Trustee and choir m
2 CONC ember, and helped on the Mission Committee. He was a World War II Army veteran where he was a conscientious objector working on vehicle repair in the Philippines. Henry worked for 37 years at Boyertown Body Works. In his retiremen
2 CONC t he volunteered as a driver for Frederick Living and Boyertown home-delivered meals.
