1 NOTE {geni:about_me} October 14, 2002|The Morning Call
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth M. Colecio, 83, of Allentown, formerly of 719 Fernwood St., Bethlehem, died Oct. 12 in Sacred Heart Hospital, Allentown.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was employed in the dietary department of St. Luke's Hospital, Fountain Hill, before retiring in 1990.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Easton, she was a daughter of the late Harvey and Grace (Cooley) Landis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors: Son, Robert T., with whom she resided; daughter, Catherine Romano of Kempton; two grandchildren, five great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Services: 10:30 a.m. Wednesday, J.S. Burkholder Funeral Home, 16th and Hamilton streets, Allentown. Call 9:30-10:30 a.m. Wednesday.
