1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sylvia Mae Wagler, 81, of Loogootee, passed away at 3:20 a.m. Saturday, March 19, 2022, at her home. She was born May 9, 1940, in Montgomery, Indiana to David and Catherine (Wagler) Stoll.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sylvia was a member of the Old Order Amish Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her parents, David and Katie Stoll; sister, Wilma (Abraham) Knepp, sisters-in-law, Rosa Stoll and Anna Mae Stoll.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sylvia is survived by her husband, Peter Wagler Jr; children, Shirley (Ben) Graber, David (Ruth) Wagler, Wilmer (Fannie) Wagler, Delbert (Virginia) Wagler and Melvin (Darla) Wagler; 26 grandchildren and 42 great-grandchildren; sib
2 CONC lings, Mary (Leroy) Knepp, Leroy Stoll, Joseph (Sarah Catherine) Stoll and David Dale (Laura) Stoll.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be held at 9:00 a.m. Monday, March 21, 2022, at the Produce Building in Montgomery. Burial will follow in Stoll Cemetery. Visitation will begin at 2:00 p.m. Saturday, March 19, 2022, and will continue until t
2 CONC he time of service at the Produce Building.
2 CONT
2 CONT Blake & Wagler Funeral Home in Montgomery is honored to serve the family of Sylvia Mae Wagler.
