1 NAME Menno D. /Miller/
2 GIVN Menno D.
2 SURN Miller
2 _MARNM Miller
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Yaggy Cemetery, Grabill,															Allen County,															Indiana,																USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 JAN 1878
2 PLAC Lagrange, Lagrange County, Indiana
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 MAY 1950
2 PLAC Allen County, Indiana, USA
2 ADDR
1 TITL Rev
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Minister Killed in Highway Accident.
2 CONT Ft. Wayne, Ind. — Menno Miller, 72, retired minister of the Cuba Conservative A. M. church near Grabill, Ind. was fatally injured in a two-car collision six miles north of here Sunday noon, May 14. Five other persons were injured 
2 CONC in the accident.
2 CONT It was the fourth fatal accident within a week in Ft. Wayne and Allen county. 
2 CONT (MWR 25 May 1950, p. 1)
2 CONT
2 CONT Miller. --- Menno D. Miller, was born near Lagrange, Ind.; Jan. 22, 1878; met death in a traffic accident May 14, 1950; aged 72 y. 3 m. 22 d. In June, 1898, he was united in marriage to Laura Yoder. This union was blessed with 9 c
2 CONC hildren (Sam and Clarence, Midland, Mich.; Wilma Fillmore, Hope, Mich.; Sarah Stark, Midland, Mich.; Alvin, Elkhart, Ind.; Katie Troyer, Goshen, Ind.; Laura Martin, Valparaiso, Ind., Fannie Lengacher, Grabill, Ind.). His wife and 
2 CONC one son (William) preceded him in death. He was married to Kate Helmuth. To this union were born one son (Floyd, Elgin, Ill.), and one daughter (Clara Helmuth, Arcola, Ill.). His second wife also predeceased him. In 1936 he was un
2 CONC ited in marriage to Fannie Delagrange, who survives. Also surviving are one sister (Anna Miller, Dover, Del.), 31 grandchildren, 2 great-grandchildren, and many other relatives and friends. In his youth he united with the church, 
2 CONC and on May 14, 1913, was ordained to the office of deacon. In which capacity he was serving at the time of his death. Funeral services were held May 16 at the Cuba Conservative Church with Emanuel Swartzendruber and Edwin Albrecht
2 CONC  in charge. 
2 CONT (Mennobits)
2 CONT * Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/32913120/menno-d-miller Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Oct 3 2024, 1:25:06 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Newbury Township, LaGrange, Indiana, United States - 1900
2 CONT * '''Residence''': Clearspring, Lagrange, Indiana, United States - 1910
