2 CONT === Veronica Hochstetler
2 CONT * Birth:	 	unknown
2 CONT * Death:	 	Mar. 4, 1811 - Somerset County, Pennsylvania
2 CONT
2 CONT Original tombstone (still extant) reads: "1811 Mertz 4 (F)renni Hochstedlerin"
2 CONT
2 CONT Born ca. 1760 in Bern Twp., Berks Co., Pa., daughter of Jacob Mast. Wife of John Hochstetler Jr. Mother of Benjamin, John, Solomon, Jeremiah, Samuel, Gideon, Abraham and Moses Hochstetler, Sarah Hershberger, Veronica Keim and Susa
2 CONC nna Yoder.
2 CONT
2 CONT The present Memorial Marker was placed in 1978 by the late Paul V. Hostetler.
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo from HHH Newsletter, Goshen, Indiana.
