2 CONT ------------------
2 CONT Joseph had the nickname "Axie" because he was known to have made fine axes.  He also founded the village of Summit Mills.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/68800800/joseph_j_yoder Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://w
