2 CONT Schrock - Mattie Yoder, 98, Goshen, Ind. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: April 24, 1897, Reno County, Kan. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: June 26, 1995, Goshen, Ind. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors-children: Elizabeth Beck, Sue Kurtz, Barbara Weaver, Alma Bontreger, Mary Y Yoder, Edward; brother: Tobe Yoder; 23 grandchildren, 50 great-grandchildren, 3 great-great grandchildren. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Predeceased by: David S Schrock (husband), Alvin (son), and 3 infant sons. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral: July 1, Holdeman Mennonite Church, by Simon Gingerich and David Heusinkveld. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Olive West Cemetery.
2 CONT
