1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edward A. Schrock, 95, Goshen, formerly of Wakarusa, died 5:55 p.m. Thursday, Feb. 9, 2017 at Greencroft Healthcare, Goshen. He was born Oct. 28, 1921 in Yoder, Kansas to David and Mattie (Yoder) Schrock. He marrie
2 CONC d Violet (Harter) Schrock on Jan. 25, 1942 in Wakarusa and she died on Dec. 1, 1999. Edward is survived by his two sons, Merlyn Schrock, Elkhart, Garry (Bonita) Schrock, Goshen, two daughters, Jan Schrock, Mishawaka, Donna (Don) B
2 CONC ailey, Dowagiac, Michigan, a sister, Sue Kurtz, Goshen, two brothers, David (Karen) Schrock, Indianapolis, Robert (Diana) Schrock, South Bend, eight grandchildren, Angie (Marc) Blosser; Jeff (Jennifer) Schrock; Brad (Lynn) Schrock
2 CONC ; Kyle, Jason, and Rachel Bailey; Allison and Emily Schrock; and 7 great-grandchildren. He is preceded in death by his parents; a son, Dean Schrock, a grandson, Shane Bailey, a brother, Alvin Schrock, and four sisters, Elizabeth B
2 CONC eck, Barbara Weaver, Alma Bontreger, and Mary Yoder. Edward was a farmer and truck driver. He was a member of Holdeman Mennonite Church, Wakarusa. Rieth-Rohrer-Ehret Funeral Homes* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/1
