1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Henry E. Miller, 78, of 2459 TR 414, Dundee, died early Monday morning, June 9, 2003 at Majora Lane Care Center in Millersburg following a period of declining health. He was born in Mount Eaton on November 20, 1924
2 CONC  to the late Emanuel B. and Katie E. Hershberger Miller and had lived all of his life in this area. On December 30, 1947 he married Ella E. Schrock. She died March 12, 1980. He then married Mattie G. Schlabach on December 8, 1983.
2 CONC  She survives. He was a member of the Old Order Amish and was a farmer and had retired from Peabody Galion in Winesburg.
2 CONT Also surviving are 4 children, Barbara (John) Bontrager of Winesburg, Marvin (Amanda) Miller of Winesburg, LaVina (Wayne) Weaver of Holmesville, and Wayne (Mary) Miller of Kidron; a stepdaughter, Katie Mae (Mose) Yoder of Trail; 9
2 CONC  grandchildren, 11 step-grandchildren, 8 great grandchildren and 18 step-great grandchildren. 
2 CONT Also surviving are 3 sisters, Susan (Henry) Yoder of Sugarcreek, Anna (Alvin) Schrock of Dundee, and Mary (Syl) Hershberger of Sarasota, FL. 
2 CONT He was preceded in death by his wife Ella, 5 brothers, 7 sisters, a granddaughter, and a step-granddaughter.
2 CONT Burial will be in the Miller Cemetery in Walnut Creek Township.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/273076146/henry_e_miller Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 24
2 CONC  2024, 3:22:11 UTC''
