1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Fredericksburg - Katie Y. Hershberger, 89, of 4303 Township Road 606, Fredericksburg, died Thursday, April 15, 2021 at her home.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born in Stark County on December 10, 1931 to the late Yost and Lovina (Yoder) Hershberger and was a member of the Old Order Amish Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by a sister, Mrs. Jacob (Emma) Stutzman of Blanchard, MI; and numerous nieces, nephews and friends.
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to her parents, she was preceded in death by brothers, Sam and Noah; sisters, Anna, Susie and Mary; a stilborn brother, Eli; a half brother and sister, Amanda and Jacob.
2 CONT
2 CONT Funeral services will be held on Sunday at 10:00 am at the family residence. Burial will be in the Hershberger Cemetery, Paint Township, Wayne County. Friends may call anytime at the residence. Spidell Funeral Home in Mount Eaton 
2 CONC is handling the arrangements.
2 CONT
2 CONT The family would like to thank the staff of Ohio's Hospice LifeCare for their kind service.
2 CONT
2 CONT Spidell
2 CONT
