1 NOTE {geni:about_me} The Las Vegas Evening Review-Journal published an article about Ezra's death by suicide (hanging) on 8 February 1946, saying that he committed the act the previous day. Link: https://www.genealogybank.com/nbshare/A
2 CONC C01220103233728280291675357124
2 CONT
2 CONT Ezra registered for the World War I draft while living in California, and had his registration forwarded to Maricopa County, Arizona, where his father Joseph lived at the time. His draft registration card lists his birth date and 
2 CONC place. Link: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:KZVW-DWY
2 CONT
2 CONT Ezra is mentioned as the son of Joseph and Rachel Egly in Joseph's obituary published in 1937. Joseph died in Ezra's home in Riverside. Link: https://www.genealogybank.com/nbshare/AC01220103233728280291675354513
2 CONT Contributor: Sean Lamb (51181461)
