1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ida Mae was born in Daviess County, IN to Peter R and Mary (Knepp) Wagler. She married Daniel Swartzentruber on July 2, 1949 and they had six sons and three daughters, all surviving her. She is preceded in death by
2 CONC  her parents; her husband; and her brothers Homer and Raymond Wagler.
