2 CONC  1760. Will proved Dec 23 1760 Weaver. Deep Run Mennonite Cemetery. Will No. 12 filed in 1761. The codicil to William's will witnessed by Jos. Nash (381) and Abraham Schwartz. Will of William Nash (1696-1760) In the name of God, A
