2 CONT * John Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Abraham Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Ursula Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Catherine Oberholtzer
2 CONT * He first married 1791 Catharina Bachmann at Bucks County, Pennsylvania. They have seven children;
2 CONT * Esther Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Elizabeth Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Jonathan Oberholtzer
2 CONT * George Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Jacob Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Catherine Oberholtzer
2 CONT * Anna Oberholtzer.
2 CONT * He second married 19JUL1807 Elizabeth Mellinger. They have 13 children;
