2 CONC o lived nearby. Histories of these other men contribute to a fuller biography of both David Sook and David Miller. One such list is for the soldiers under George Miars Captain in the Militia of Washington Co. PA. David Sook is lis
2 CONC ted 2nd Class.</p>
2 CONT <p style="font-size: 14px; font-family: 'Open Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; text-transform: none; font-weight: 400; color: #000000; font-style: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; margin: 
