2 CONC rman</a><span>&nbsp;</span>(Brethren family) Christian Leatherman (Baptized David Miller's father) Jacob Shildler (Relative of Peter Shidler, brother-in-law of David Zook) James Bradin (Possibly neighbor of Samuel Miller - Patent 
2 CONC map) Jacob Bradin (Possibly nieghbor of Samuel Miller) Joseph Bedle (Possible related to Beedle son-in-law of Nicholas Miller) Adam Heartman (Likely Adam Hartman at baptism of David Miller's father.) James Allison (Perhaps namesak
2 CONC e for PA town where Samuel Miller lived) Barklet Griffith (Possible relative of Nicholas Miller in Ohio) Nicholas Miars (Possible key to George Miars identity) James Crail (Maybe a Grable/Crable) Docter Luallen (Welshman related t
2 CONC o the 1st Lieutenant) Peter Shidler (brother in law of David Zook) George Shidler (relative of Peter shidler) George Friend (relative of John Friend who sold land to David Miller's father) Ezekiel Bradin (relative of other Bradin)
2 CONC  Peter Leatherman (relative of other Leatherman) John Miller (Awaiting discover of relationship to other Millers) Henry Shidler (relative of Shidler) Mothias Jague (Probably Tague and then relative of Grable in KY) Rees Gaddis (re
2 CONC lative of Gaddis famous for organizing troops) Fredrick Tague (Teague relative) Michael Tague (Teague relative) Daniel Leatherman (baptized David Miller's father) Philip Friend (Friend relative) Tobias Friend (Friend relative) Fra
2 CONC nces Bedle (Bedle relative) George Weech (maybe wrench neighbor in Franklin Co. PA)</p>
