1 NAME Stella Swartz /Hager/
2 GIVN Stella Swartz
2 SURN Hager
2 _MARNM Dise
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC 	 Saint Johns Lutheran Cemetery Spinnerstown, Bucks County, Pennsylvania, USA
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 JAN 1922
1 DEAT
2 DATE 11 OCT 2019
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/92261204/stella-swartz-dise
2 CONT
2 CONT Stella S. Dise, formerly of Perkasie, PA, passed away on Friday, October 11, 2019 at the Lutheran Community at Telford. She was 97.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the wife of the late Stanley A. Dise, who died May 26, 2010.
2 CONT
2 CONT Born in Bedminster Twp., PA, she was the daughter of the late Rufus and Nora (Swartz) Hager.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mrs. Dise worked as a seamstress for A. G. Pants Factory, Perkasie for many years until retiring in 1987. Prior to that, she worked the Dutch Maid Laundry, Doylestown, PA and the Dublin Pants Factory, Dublin, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was a member of Christ Community Bible Church, Perkasie, where she was active with the White Cross Sewing Circle.
2 CONT
2 CONT An avid quilter, she enjoyed making quilts for each of her grandchildren as well as many others. She also enjoyed baking, gardening, singing and watching and feeding the birds.
2 CONT
2 CONT She is survived by two sons, David D. Dise and his wife Sandra, of Hilltown Twp. PA and Ronald S. Dise and his wife Rowena, of Bedminster Twp., PA; nine grandchildren and 11 great grandchildren; a sister, Eva Hager, of Richfield, 
2 CONC PA. She was preceded in death by a sister, Irene Rice and two brothers, Herbert and Lamar Hager.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her funeral services will be held at 11 AM on Thursday, October 17, 2019 at Christ Community Bible Church, 1830 Ridge Road, Perkasie, PA, where family and friends may call from 10:00 to 11:00 AM. Interment will follow in St. John’
2 CONC s Evangelical Lutheran Cemetery, Spinnerstown, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Suess Funeral Home
