1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/154189452/samuel-l_-histand
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel L. Histand III passed away Saturday, Feb. 25, 2012, at Reading Hospital. He was 74. Born in Doylestown on Aug. 7, 1937, Sam was the son of Samuel L. Histand II and Myrtle (Stover) Histand. He was the husband of Marilyn (Dra
2 CONC ke) for 54 years and is survived by three daughters, Barbara J. Histand of Mansfield, Diane J. Zaleski (Joseph S.) of Mohrsville, and Susan J. Histand of Reading; two sons, Clifford A. Histand (Mariam) of Roslyn, and Carl Histand 
2 CONC of Lansdale; seven grandchildren, Victor Histand, Jennifer and Bradly Histand and J. Kerry, Andrew, Casey and Connor Zaleski; and one sister, Joan Leigh (Histand) Young. He was preceded in death by his brother, Allan Histand. Fami
2 CONC ly and friends are invited to Sam's memorial service at 11 a.m. on Friday, March 16 at the Family Worship Center of Lansdale, 1000 Troxel Rd., Lansdale, PA 19446. Memorial contributions in Sam's name may be made to The American Ca
2 CONC ncer Society Relay for Life c/o 157 Victoria Dr., Mohrsville, PA 19541. Auer Cremation Services of Pa., Inc.
2 CONT
