2 CONT Histand, Fannie K. (Good), 89, Souderton, Pa. Born: June 7, 1903, East Petersburg, Pa., to Daniel H. and Anna K. Kreider Good. Died: July 22, 1992, Sellersville, Pa. Survivors-son: Ernest G.; stepchildren: Herbert H., Norman H., W
2 CONC alter H., Robert H., Lena Hunsberger, Mary Reinford, Mabel Detweiler, Nancy Kulp, June Histand; sisters: Anna Becker, Ella Hess; 2 grandchildren, 4 great-grandchildren, 25 stepgrandchildren, 18 step-great-grandchildren. Predecease
2 CONC d by: Daniel L. Histand (second husband) and Abram L. Histand (first husband). Funeral and burial: July 25, Doylestown Mennonite Church, by Duane Bishop and Henry L. Ruth.
2 CONT
