1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/201430814/mary-reinford
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary (Histand) Reinford, of Telford, PA went home to be with the Lord on her 87th birthday, Sunday, July 21st, 2019.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was the loving wife of Ernest L. Reinford for 63 years. Mary was born in Doylestown, PA to the late Daniel L. and Nora (Huddle) Histand.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was employed throughout her working career as a Nurse’s Aide at Telford Lutheran Home and Grand View Hospital, Sellersville, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT During her early marriage she was a member of Skippack Mennonite Church. She later became a member of Souderton Mennonite Church where she was known as the “Birthday Lady”.
2 CONT
2 CONT In addition to her husband, Ernie, she is survived by three daughters, Pattie (Dennis) Mishler of Brownsburg, IN, Connie Reinford of Telford, PA and Luanne (Rodney) Grasse of Chalfont, PA; two sons, Duane Reinford of Souderton, PA
2 CONC  and Douglas Reinford of Quakertown, PA; nine grandchildren, Jackie, Corbin, Shelly, Andrew, Randy, Becca, Landon, Dalton and Tom; three great-grandchildren, Eivin, Liam and Avery; three sisters, Lena Hunsberger of Souderton, PA, 
2 CONC Nancy (Clarence) Kulp of Myerstown, PA and June Histand of Lower Gwynedd, PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by five brothers, John, Herbert, Walter, Norman, Robert and two sisters, Edna Bruele and Mabel Detweiler.
2 CONT
2 CONT A Celebration of Life service will be held on Monday, August 19th, 2019 at 7:00 pm at Souderton Mennonite Church, 105 W. Chestnut St., Souderton, PA 18964 where friends may meet with the family from 5:30 pm - 6:30 pm.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inurnment will take place at Souderton Mennonite Church at the convenience of the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anders-Detweiler Funeral Home
