2 CONT Norman Huddle Histand was living in Mesa, AZ when he went home to be with the Lord at age 70. Norm was born in Doylestown, PA to Daniel and Nora Histand. He married Grace Arline Selzer in Hesston, KS, December 18, 1966. He was a p
2 CONC ainting contractor and a member of the Mennonite Church, in Glenwood Springs, CO for many years. He enjoyed fishing, hunting, computers and traveling. He was a real people person who was always ready to help anyone with his many s
2 CONC kills or in any way he could. Norm and Grace have traveled for 24 years all over the country and made hundreds of friends. Spending most summers in Gunnison, CO and winters in Casa Grande, AZ having just moved to Mesa, AZ this win
2 CONC ter. He was loved and will be missed by all.
