2 CONC 9, he was married to Rebecca Histand, who survives. Also surviving are one son (Leon ), 2 daughters (Betty Lou Myers and Carol Toll), 10 grandchildren, 8 great -grandchildren, one brother (Chester), and one sister (Ruth Graybill )
2 CONC . On Dec. 7, 1943, he was ordained to the ministry and served the Doylestown congregation until 1970. He was a member of Doylestown Mennonite Church, where funeral services were held on Oct. 29, in charge of Ray Yoder and Wellingt
2 CONC on Alderfer; interment in the church cemetery.
