2 CONT David (Leon) Graybill, 86, Loogootee, died Thursday, Jan. 31, 2019, at his home. Born March 28, 1932, in Souderton, Pa., he was the son of the late Joseph Silas and Rebecca Histand Graybill.
2 CONT
2 CONT Besides his parents, he was preceded in death by two children, Rhoda Graybill and David Graybill Jr., and a sister, Betty Lou Myers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include his wife of 66 years, the former Janis Bromley; five children, Sharon Wolfe (Ed) of Spencer, Lois Austin (Kenneth) of Leavenworth, Rachel Walls and Sarah Greene (Dustin), both of Loogootee, and Ruth King (Terry) 
2 CONC of Taswell; a sister, Carol Toll (Bob) of Peoria, Ill.; a brother-in-law, Wilson Myers of Harrisonburg, Va.; seven grandchildren; and 12 great-grandchildren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arrangements: Blake Funeral Home in Loogootee. Cremation was chosen.
