1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/177679094/martyne-wetzel
2 CONT
2 CONT Martyne Ruth was born on a farm along "The Branch" creek in Lower Salford Township in Pennsylvania. She and her family attended the Finland Mennonite Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Conrad L. Wetzel of Colchester, Illinois, on January 14, 1961.
2 CONT
2 CONT After their three sons graduated from high school, Martyne enjoyed working for many years at the University of Illinois in Champaign.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martyne especially loved to sing. She and Conrad were members for several years of the Chicago Symphony Chorus and she performed with the Oratorio Society at the University of Illinois. She also played the guitar and recorder.
