2 CONT ** Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/person/details/LBGS-8W9 FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 20 2020, 20:18:10 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha M. Bender, 85, passed away Thursday, December 1, 2016, at Goshen Hospital after a brief illness.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born June 24, 1931 in Goshen to Noah and Laura (Miller) Kaufman.
2 CONT
2 CONT On March 18, 1951 she married Edward L. Bender at Pleasant Grove Church, Goshen.  He died February 19, 2016.
2 CONT
2 CONT Survivors include five children, Joyce E. Burkhead of Goshen, Lamar (Karen) Bender of Hesston, Kansas, Darrell (Sarah) Bender of New Paris, Randy (Debbie) Bender of Granger and Ronald (Paula) Bender of Lynchburg, Virginia; seven g
2 CONC randchildren and eight great-grandchildren; four sisters, Wilma (Fred) Springer of Long Beach, California, Mary Ellen (Marvin) Miller of Sarasota, Florida, Pauline Borntrager of Goshen and Verna Kaufman of Elkhart and three brothe
2 CONC rs, Wilbur (Martha) Kaufman and Calvin (Loretta) Kaufman, both of Goshen and David (Mickie) Kaufman of Winona Lake.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was preceded in death by her parents, her husband, two grandsons, Noah Bender and Derek Burkhead and a brother, Leon Kaufman.
2 CONT
2 CONT A member of Grace United Methodist Church, Mrs. Bender enjoyed quilting, flower gardening and spending time with her grandchildren and great-grandchildren.  She was well known for her dinner rolls.
2 CONT
2 CONT She worked at Goshen Rubber for 20 years, retiring in 1986.
2 CONT
2 CONT Yoder-Culp Funeral Home
