2 CONT '''- Peachey.- Clara E., daughter of Enoch and Mary Bender, was born at Springs, Pa., June 17, 1885; died at Grantsville, Md., Sept. 2, 1967; aged 82 y. 2 m. 16 d. On Nov. 30, 1919, she was married to Ezra J. Peachey, who died Jan
2 CONC . 5, 1965. Surviving are one daughter (Viola-Mrs. Clarence Scheffel), one son (Ezra), 4 stepchildren (Ray, Merle, Leonard, and Thelma-Mrs. John Bawel), 2 brothers, 2 sisters, 26 grandchildren, and 30 great-grandchildren. She was a
2 CONC  member of the Locust Grove Church, where funeral services were held Sept. 5, with John B. Zook, Louis Peachey, and Erie Renno officiating. (Gospel Herald - Volume LX, Number 44 - November 7, 1967, pages 1026, 1027.)* Reference: [
2 CONC http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=kishvalley&id=I2936 RootsWeb's WorldConnect] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 24 2017, 20:27:34 UTC''
