1 NOTE {geni:about_me} YODER. - On the 28th of Nov., near Nappanee, Elkhart county, Ind., after ten days suffering of heart disease, Sister Lydia, wife of Simon Yoder, aged 67 years, 7 months and 23 days. 
2 CONT She leaves her husband and 10 children to mourn her departure; yet they mourn not as those who have no hope. 
2 CONT Services by J. C. Schlabach from John 5:24-30; I Cor. 15 and I Thess. 4:13-18. Peace to her ashes.
