2 CONT Born ca. 1757/1758 in Bern Twp., Berks Co., Pa., son of John and Catherine (Hertzler) Hochstetler. Husband of Veronica Mast. Father of Benjamin, John, Solomon, Jeremiah, Samuel, Gideon, Abraham and Moses Hochstetler, Sarah Hershbe
2 CONC rger, Veronica Keim and Susanna Yoder.
2 CONT
2 CONT John is buried at the "Old Joel Hershberger Farm Cemetery", Elklick Twp, Summit Mills, Somerset Co., PA, Plot # 37 in the Bender Survey of 1934. No original tombstone extant, but probably the grave next to his wife with the uninsc
2 CONC ribed fieldstone. The present Memorial Marker was placed in 1978 by the late Paul V. Hostetler.
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo from HHH Newsletter, Goshen, Indiana.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:	(Hans) Johan/Johann Jakob Hoffstadler, Maria/Marie Eva Hoffstadler (born Trautman/Troutmann)
