1 NOTE {geni:about_me} BURKHOLDER.-On the 16th of Dec., 1893, near Berlinton, Marshall Co., Ind., Bro. John Burkholder, aged 80 years, 8 months and 9 days.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a faithful member in the old Amish branch of the Mennonite denomination since his youth. He leaves three sons and many grandchildren and great grandchildren to mourn his death.
2 CONT
2 CONT Buried on the 17th near Burkholder's school house. Appropriate remarks were made on the occasion by John C. Schlabach from John 5:24-30, and 1 Cor. 15, and 1 Thess. 4:13-18.
