2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/44501163/christian_yoder
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT CHRISTIAN YODER was born 1722 in Steffisburg, Bern, Switzerland. Being from Switzerland. He married BARBARA BEILER, daughter of JACOB CHRISTIAN BEILER and BARBARA VERONICA "FERONA" YODER. She was born 1723 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and 
2 CONC died 1781 in BERKS CO,PA.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 17. BARBARA YODER was born 1700 in BERN CANTON,SWI.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of BARBARA YODER and JACOB YODER are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. MICHAEL YODER was born 1730 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1799 in UNION TWP,MIFFLIN CO,PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. ii. JACOB "STRONG JACOB" YODER was born 1726 in GUGGISBERG,BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1790 in LANCASTER CO,PA. He married ANNA BEILER, daughter of JACOB CHRISTIAN BEILER and BARBARA VERONICA "FERONA" YODER. She was born 1726 in 
2 CONC BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1804 in LANCASTER CO,PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. JOHN "HANS" YODER was born 1732 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1804 in BERKS CO,PA. He married ANNA BERKEY, daughter of JACOB BERKEY and ELIZABETH MISHLER. She was born 1732, and died 1804. He married MAGDALENA MAST. She was bo
2 CONC rn 1734 in PA, and died in PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. CATHERINE YODER was born 1720 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died in BERKS CO,PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''v. CHRISTIAN YODER was born 1722 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died  1772 in BERKS CO,PA. He married BARBARA BEILER, daughter of JACOB CHRISTIAN BEILER and BARBARA VERONICA "FERONA" YODER. She was born 1723 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and di
2 CONC ed 1781 in BERKS CO,PA.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 13. vi. ANNA YODER was born 1728 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died in BERKS CO,PA. She married SAMUEL KING. He was born Abt 1724 in GER/SWI, and died Abt 1785 in PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. BARBARA YODER was born 1734 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1790 in LANCASTER CO,PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. VERONICA YODER was born 1736 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1806 in MIFFLIN CO,PA. She married JOHN R HARTZLER, son of JACOB HARTZLER. He was born 1729 in BAS-RHIN,FRA, and died APR 1801 in BERKS CO,PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. MAGDALENA YODER was born 1724 in BERN CANTON,SWI. She married CHRISTIAN FISHER, son of HEIN ULRICH FISHER. He was born 1724 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1768 in CHESTER CO,PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 18. JACOB CHRISTIAN BEILER was born 7 AUG 1687 in GUGGISBERG,BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1771 in PA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 19. BARBARA VERONICA "FERONA" YODER was born 1702 in BERN CANTON,SWI, and died 1737 in BERKS CO,PA. She was the daughter of 38. HANS YODER and 39. ANNA EICHER.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT d 20 Nov 1816 in Berks co,Pa.D 1771?Immigration: 21 SEP 1742 From Rotterdam,Netherlands to Philadelphia,Pennsylvania on Ship Francis & Elizabeth  YrRu gives birth as 1728
2 CONT
2 CONT - Christian & Barbara Yoder resided on a farm which they obtained by warrant from John & Richard Penn, proprietaries of Pa. Oct. 19th, 1743 in Berne Twp, Lancaster Co, now Upper Berne Twp, Berks Co. for 102 acres and allowance joi
2 CONC ng land with jacob Hertzler on the southwest side of his farm, two and one-half miles from Hamburg, Berks Co., Pa. (HJ p. 190) Arrived 8 Oct 1737?
2 CONT
2 CONT A tax list of Bern township, Berks County, in 1754 includes the following names, Jacob Burkey, Jacob Burkey, Jr., Christian Byler, Hans Curtis, Christian Fisher, Jacob Good, Christian Kauffman, Jacob Kauffman, Jacob Hartzler, Jaco
2 CONC b Hochstetler, Christian Hershberger, Christian King, Samuel King, Stephen Kurtz, Hans Lantz, Jacob Mayer, Jacob Mast, Jacob Miller, Nicholas Miller, John Miller, Jacob Reesor, Christian Stutzman, Jacob Stutzman, Christian Yoder, 
2 CONC Christian Yoder, Jr., Jacob Yoder, John Yoder, Christian Zoog, Moritz Zoog and Hans Zimmerman?
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Minister and Bishop of the Amish Church. Died in Stonycreek Twp. Grave not inscribed.
2 CONT ----
