2 CONT THE HERTZLER-HARTZLER FAMILY HISTORY [1952] page 621
2 CONT
2 CONT 8037 Christian Hertzler2, 1, b Palatinate, France, 1744, d Feb. 18, 1817; married first Elizabeth Yoder, d Jan. 11, 1791; daugther of Christian and Barbara Yoder. Elizabeth Yoder Hertzler is buried on the original home farm 2 mile
2 CONC s west of Hamburg, in the Amish burying ground there. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Christian Hertzler (1744 - 1817)
2 CONT
