1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * '''Residence''': Walnut Creek, Holmes, Ohio, United States - 1880
2 CONT ** Reference: [https://familysearch.org/tree/person/details/K22L-XDW FamilySearch Genealogy] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 6 2020, 22:15:26 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Helmuth, son of Fredrick (1794-1873) and Anna Yoder Helmuth (1798-1841), was born Mar. 19, 1840 in the state of Ohio, Holmes County, where he was raised.  He married Barbara Herschberger, daughter of Paul Herschberger on Ma
2 CONC rch 8, 1860.  In 1863 they moved to Johnson County, Iowa, and in 1864 moved back to Holmes County, Ohio.  
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1881 Mr. Helmuth came to Arthur, Moultrie County, Illinois where he died July 18, 1897 at 3 o'clock.  His age was 57 yrs, 3 mo. and 29 da. His was the first death in this family.
2 CONT
2 CONT He leaves a wife and 12 children, the dates of whose births are as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara Helmuth (wife)____ Oct 14, 1841
2 CONT Abraham __________________ Dec 5, 1860
2 CONT Moses ____________________ Sept 17, 1862
2 CONT Faranica _________________ Oct 12, 1863
2 CONT Joni _____________________ Nov 4, 1865
2 CONT Daniel & Elizabeth (twins)June 10, 1867
2 CONT Samuel __________________ Sept 9, 1869
2 CONT Joseph J. _______________ Oct 22, 1871
2 CONT Gertrude ________________ July 18, 1873
2 CONT Lavinah _________________ April 15, 1877
2 CONT Menno ___________________ Jan 10, 1880
2 CONT Magdalene _______________ Aug 6, 1882
2 CONT
