1 NOTE OBITUARY FROM THE FAMILY RECORD - "THE DESCENDENTS OF JOHN WITMER AND JACOB ROTH BY A. C. HIRSCHY BERNE, INDIANA MENNONITE PUBLISHING HOUSE 1901.
2 CONT ELIZABETH SCHROCK WAS BORN IN JUNTINGTON COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA, FEBRUARY 7, 1806.  AT THE AGE OF SIX YEARS SHE REMOVED WITH HER PARENTS TO HOLMES COUNTY, OHIO WHERE SHE GREW TO WOMANHOOD AND WAS UNITED IN MARRIAGE IN 1824 TO HENRY 
2 CONC SAUDER, WHO WAS BORN MAY 4, 1802.  AFTER TWO YEARS SHE WITH HER HUSBAND MOVED TO WAYNE COUNTY, OHIO, WHERE THEY RESIDED NEARLY TWENTY YEARS.  THEY CONCLUDED TO GO FARTHER WEST AND DID SO SETTLING NEARLY FIFTY YEARS AGO ONE HALF MI
2 CONC LE NORTH OF LEO, ALLEN COUNTY, INDIANA.  SHE WAS THE MOTHER OF NINE CHILDREN, FOUR BOYS AND FIVE GIRLS.  OF THIS NUMBER SIX ARE LIVING;  SHE HAS ALSO ONE BROTHER AND TWO SISTERS LIVING.  HER GRANDCHILDREN NUMBER EIGHTY TWO AND 59 
2 CONC ARE LIVING;  OF GREAT GRANDCHILDREN THERE ARE TWO HUNDRED AND SEVENTY FIVE - TWO HUNDRED AND FORTY TWO ARE NOW LIVING.  OF GREAT, GREAT GRANDCHILDREN SEVENTEEN, OF WHICH MUMBER FORTEEN ARE LIVING.  ONE BRANCH OF THE FAMILY ALONE H
2 CONC AS MORE THAN ONE HUNDRED GREAT GRANDCHILDREN.  MOTHER SAUDER HAS BEEN A LIFELONG MEMBER OF THE MENNONITE CHURCH AND WAS FAITHFUL UNTIL DEATH.  HER HUSBAND PRECEEDED HER BY MANY YEARS TO THE OTHER SHORE, HAVING DIED FEBRUARY 11, 18
2 CONC 55.  HER DEATH OCCURRED ON DECEMBER 17, 1898 AT THE RIPE OLD AGE OF 92 YEARS, 10 MONTHS, AND 10 DAYS.  APPROPRIATE FUNERAL SERVICES WERE HELD AT THE MENNONITE CHURCH, CONDUCTED BY THE REV. ANDREW GERIG.  THE REMAINS WERE INTERRED 
2 CONC IN THE CEMETERY OF THAT DENOMINATION, THREE MILES SOUTH OF THAT PLACE.
2 CONT "CALM ON THE BOSOM OF THY GOD,
2 CONT FAIR SPIRIT, REST THEE NOW!
2 CONT E'EN WHILE WITH US THY FOOTSTEPS TROD,
2 CONT HIS SEAL WAS ON THY BROW.
2 CONT DUST, TO ITS NARRW HOUSE BENEATH!
2 CONT SOUL, TO ITS PLACE ON HIGH!
2 CONT THEY THAT HAVE SEEN THY LOOK IN DEATH,
2 CONT NO MORE MAY FEAR TO DIE.
2 CONT LONE ARE THE PATHS AND SAD THE BOWERS,
2 CONT WHENCE THY MEEK SMILE IS GONE;
2 CONT BUT O! A BRIGHTER HOME THAN OURS,
2 CONT IN HEAVEN IN THINE OWN
